menu "APML driver support"

config APML_SBRMI
    tristate "AMD side band RMI support"
    depends on I3C
    help
      Side band RMI over I3C support for AMD out of band management.

      This driver can also be built as a module.

config APML_SBTSI
    tristate "AMD side band TSI support"
    depends on I3C
    help
      Side band TSI over I3C support for AMD out of band management.

      This driver can also be built as a module.
endmenu
